b:["$","p","p-1",{"children":"在本系列的前面所有篇章中，我们对非阻塞类的并发操作进行了详细的阐述和实践（除了 SpinLock，不过自旋锁是通过自旋来实现阻塞作用，本质上线程并没有陷入阻塞等待的状态）。"}]
c:["$","p","p-2",{"children":["后面我们将继续参考 ",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://marabos.nl/atomics/","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://marabos.nl/atomics/"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Rust Atomics and Locks","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":12,"offset":606},"end":{"line":17,"column":34,"offset":628}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":11,"offset":605},"end":{"line":17,"column":64,"offset":658}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"Rust Atomics and Locks"}]," 书中的后续篇章，继续手写几个阻塞类的并发工具，有 Mutex（互斥锁）、RwLock（读写锁）和 CondVar（条件变量）。它们都有一个共同的特点：",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"线程会陷入阻塞，让出 CPU，在等待某个条件满足要求后，会被唤醒并重新调度执行"}],"。这就需要借助内核的能力了，我们需要内核支持："]}]
d:["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":"记住那些陷入阻塞的线程；"}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":"在满足条件后，能够唤醒对应的正确的线程。"}],"\n"]}]
e:["$","p","p-3",{"children":["熟悉操作系统原理的读者应该清楚，我们编写的应用程序，一般是处于",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"用户态"}],"，而想要跟内核进行交互，需要陷入",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"内核态"}],"，而这种切换，很大程度需要依赖于操作系统提供的系统调用能力，即 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"syscall"}],"。"]}]
f:["$","p","p-4",{"children":"所以在进入手写 Mutex、RwLock 和 CondVar 篇章之前，我们需要先来学习一下，不同的操作系统，都为我们在并发操作中提供了什么样的能力和限制。"}]
10:["$","p","p-5",{"children":["在 ",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://marabos.nl/atomics/os-primitives.html","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://marabos.nl/atomics/os-primitives.html"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Rust Atomics and Locks","position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":4,"offset":1031},"end":{"line":26,"column":26,"offset":1053}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":3,"offset":1030},"end":{"line":26,"column":74,"offset":1101}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"Rust Atomics and Locks"}]," 第八章（Operating System Primitives）中，作者介绍并比较了各平台提供的操作系统级并发原语，包括 POSIX 的 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"pthread"}]," 系列、Linux 的 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"futex"}],"、macOS 的 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"os_unfair_lock"}],"，以及 Windows 的",["$","code","code-3",{"className":"$undefined","children":"重量级内核对象"}],"、",["$","code","code-4",{"className":"$undefined","children":"轻量级对象"}],"和",["$","code","code-5",{"className":"$undefined","children":"基于地址的等待机制"}],"。"]}]
