39:["$","p","p-36",{"children":["不过值得注意的是，在 macOS 10.12 版本之前，macOS 的 pthread lock 默认都是公平锁（fair locks），不过在 macOS 10.12 (Sierra, 2016) 起新增了 ",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/os/os_unfair_lock","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/os/os_unfair_lock"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"os_unfair_lock","position":{"start":{"line":140,"column":107,"offset":5495},"end":{"line":140,"column":121,"offset":5509}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":140,"column":106,"offset":5494},"end":{"line":140,"column":183,"offset":5571}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"os_unfair_lock"}],"，它是一个不公平、阻塞型、低开销的锁，取代了已弃用的 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"OSSpinLock"}],"。"]}]
3a:["$","p","p-37",{"children":["需要注意，",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"os_unfair_lock"}]," 没有提供对应的条件变量或读写锁功能 。也就是说，如果需要使用条件等待或读写锁语义，仍需使用 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"pthread_cond_t"}]," 或 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"pthread_rwlock_t"}]," 等 POSIX 原语，或者使用更高层的 GCD（Grand Central Dispatch）并发模型。Apple 将",["$","code","code-3",{"className":"$undefined","children":"os_unfair_lock"}]," 定位为替代早期的 ",["$","code","code-4",{"className":"$undefined","children":"OSSpinLock"}]," 的低级锁，以解决 ",["$","code","code-5",{"className":"$undefined","children":"OSSpinLock"}]," 存在的优先级反转问题，同时提供比 ",["$","code","code-6",{"className":"$undefined","children":"pthread_mutex"}]," 更快的性能。",["$","code","code-7",{"className":"$undefined","children":"os_unfair_lock"}]," 内部会在必要时让出 CPU 而非自旋等待，从而避免高优先级线程饥饿，但调度上又不像 ",["$","code","code-8",{"className":"$undefined","children":"pthread_mutex"}]," 那样严格 FIFO。"]}]
