3e:["$","p","p-39",{"children":["Windows 的重量级同步原语是由内核完全管理的对象，典型代表包括：",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Mutex"}],"（互斥量）、",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"Event"}],"（事件）、",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"Semaphore"}],"（信号量）、",["$","strong","strong-3",{"children":"WaitableTimer"}],"（可等待计时器）等 。这些对象通过 Windows API 创建，相当于创建了一个内核对象句柄（",["$","strong","strong-4",{"children":"HANDLE"}],"），类似打开文件会得到文件句柄一样 。每个对象在内核有对应的数据结构，操作系统维护其状态和等待队列。具体可以参考： ",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/sysinfo/kernel-objects","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/sysinfo/kernel-objects"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"重量级内核对象","position":{"start":{"line":150,"column":218,"offset":6790},"end":{"line":150,"column":225,"offset":6797}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":150,"column":217,"offset":6789},"end":{"line":150,"column":298,"offset":6870}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"重量级内核对象"}],"。"]}]
